TandemFolio
Copyright 2026 TandemFolio contributors.

TandemFolio is a modified derivative of the Apache-2.0 GenOffice
community edition. It removes product AI, login, account, branding, and
Electron host integrations from the shipped build and adds an MCP Apps host
bridge and Codex plugin packaging. The pinned source baseline and the status
of retained areas are documented in `docs/migration/ledger.md`.

Modified-source notice: the exact upstream-derived files modified by
TandemFolio are identified in `docs/migration/provenance.md` under
"Modified upstream community files". Original copyright notices remain in
the affected source files.

Bundled fonts and their licenses are documented in
apps/docs/src/renderer/fonts/README.md.

